    "text": "The general solution of the differential equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>∀</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>yf</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>,</mo></math> (where,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> is an arbitrary constant). If <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
