    "text": "Given equation is<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math><br />IF<math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></math><math><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br />Thus, the solution is<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>·</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
